{{/*
The Workspace-scoped client (ADR 0017, "Form B"). For every entity that carries the
workspace mixin it generates distinct wrapper types behind `client.Scoped(ws)`:
creates cannot name a Workspace, every reference id set on a create/update is verified
against the same Workspace when the builder is saved, and reads, update-by-id and
delete-by-id are confined to the Workspace. Regenerate with `mise run generate`.
*/}}
